ableFuture<Result>` through `AbstractResult`, but exposes neither of the completion methods detected above. Both handles are null, so this returns false and the provider span ends before a delayed result completes, losing its full duration and terminal failure. Add a `CompletionStage` fallback and exercise the shared delayed-provider test against 2.7.2 as well as 2.7.0.","comment_commit_id":"b0570b1f9337a333799aa6c407832deb0e8bad83","comment_id":4315759746,"key":"inline:4315759746","kind":"inline","line":118,"original_commit_id":"6e8b4c4fe39ec87700a9a4a1ad5a2cf914dd5975","original_line":118,"path":"instrumentation/apache-dubbo-2.7/library-autoconfigure/src/main/java/io/opentelemetry/instrumentation/apachedubbo/v2_7/TracingFilter.java","review_commit_id":"6e8b4c4fe39ec87700a9a4a1ad5a2cf914dd5975","review_id":5574000385,"review_submitted_at":"2026-10-19T15:35:37Z","root_author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"thread_context":[{"author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"body_hash":"0ed1980611af21f447ab3d5be3e51b89d75f0a117467a6ea5dde209797ddd854","id":4315759746,"parent":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-19T15:35:37Z"}],"thread_id":"PRRT_kwDODJKVX86t_XfD"},{"body":"[General] Catch and log telemetry failures inside this callback. Dubbo 2.7.5's `whenCompleteWithContext` replaces its response future with the callback's dependent stage and restores `RpcContext` only after the callback returns. If `instrumenter.end` throws, for example from a custom `AttributesExtractor.onEnd`, a successful RPC becomes exceptional and context restoration is skipped. The catch around `MethodHandle.invoke` cannot intercept exceptions captured by that stage. Keep telemetry failures from escaping the callback, and add a regression test with a throwing extractor.","comment_commit_id":"b0570b1f9337a333799aa6c407832deb0e8bad83","comment_id":4315759828,"key":"inline:4315759828","kind":"inline","line":95,"original_commit_id":"6e8b4c4fe39ec87700a9a4a1ad5a2cf914dd5975","original_line":95,"path":"instrumentation/apache-dubbo-2.7/library-autoconfigure/src/main/java/io/opentelemetry/instrumentation/apachedubbo/v2_7/TracingFilter.java","review_commit_id":"6e8b4c4fe39ec87700a9a4a1ad5a2cf914dd5975","review_id":5574000385,"review_submitted_at":"2026-10-19T15:35:37Z","root_author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"thread_context":[{"author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"body_hash":"d23f51206b4316d7b3c6c584ac3dd9a79116d69fc6303b9f963a0a3a6aa4cf00","id":4315759828,"parent":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-19T15:35:37Z"}],"thread_id":"PRRT_kwDODJKVX86t_Xf4"}],"frozen_at":1792460416,"frozen_at_iso":"2026-10-20T01:40:16Z","frozen_sha":"b0570b1f9337a333799aa6c407832deb0e8bad83","head_ref":"copilot/pr-3-async-provider-completion","head_repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","head_repo_id":210933087,"input_mode":"direct","launch_run":{"actor_id":218610,"attempt":1,"id":39354698154},"loop_kind":"copilot_review","metadata":{"body":"<!--\nCHANGELOG.md is generated from merged pull requests. Do not add an entry unless this PR introduces\na deprecation or breaking change.\n-->\n\nKeep Dubbo provider spans recording until asynchronous results complete, capturing the full duration and failures carried by either the future or response. Port only the Dubbo slice from #20675, stacked on #20721.\n\n- **Compatibility:** Use `Result.whenCompleteWithContext` where available and `AsyncRpcResult.getResultFuture` on early 2.7 versions; preserve client and synchronous behavior.\n- **Coverage:** Add direct completion/error tests and shared delayed-provider integration tests for library and javaagent instrumentation, retaining legacy, RPC preview, and duplicate telemetry assertions. Pin an additional javaagent suite to Dubbo 2.7.0.","title":"End Dubbo provider spans on asynchronous completion"},"mode":"publish","pr":20728,"pr_author_id":198982749,"protocol":"git-candidate-v1","publication":{